मदयितुनु, उस्, उस्, उ, intoxicating, exhilarating;
maddening; gladdening; (उस्), m. the god of love;
a distiller of spirituous liquor; a drunken man; a
cloud; (उस्, उ), m. n. spirituous liquor.

मदिष्ठ, अस्, आ, अम्, Ved. very intoxicating or
exhilarating (as Soma); very gladdening or delightful;
(आ), f. any intoxicating drink, spirituous liquor.

मद्वन्, आ, अरी, अ, Ved. addicted to intoxication,
fond of enjoyment, giving enjoyment, intoxicating;
(आ), m. an epithet of Śiva.
